Runtime dependencies: none (Python standard library only).
Development-only dependencies, not distributed with the public build: pytest (MIT), Playwright for Python (Apache-2.0).

Demo data
---------
All money shown by the interactive scenarios is simulated play money. public_data/public_evidence.json is an
identifier-free summary of a frozen PayPal SANDBOX record (no production funds). public_data/llm_evidence.json, when present,
is a recorded run of a hosted language model; the enforcement shown in it is simulated. The simulated gateway on this site
does not protect any live PayPal transaction.
